{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49518","headline":"生查子 二 · 魏承班","name":"生查子 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寂寞画堂空，深夜垂罗幕。\n灯暗锦屏欹，月冷珠帘薄。\n愁恨梦难成，何处贪欢乐。\n看看又春来，还是长萧索。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"魏承班","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49518.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49518","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}